# Qwen Code: shell is run_shell_command, reader is read_file, questions are
# ask_user_question; plan-mode tools are snake_case; AGENTS.md is the context file.
# No per-subagent model hint, so Claude's `model:` tier clause is dropped (conventions §11.6).
AskUserQuestion	`ask_user_question`
`Agent`	`agent`
\bBash\b	`run_shell_command`
`Read`	`read_file`
CLAUDE\.md	AGENTS.md
CLAUDE	AGENTS
, `model:` the (?:READ|EXEC|PLAN) tier value, omitted when empty	
`ExitPlanMode`	`exit_plan_mode`
ExitPlanMode	exit_plan_mode
EnterPlanMode	enter_plan_mode
